{"id":"e4ff0dbf2ccbb847","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-positive-formula.md","title":"对真理谓词为正的公式","display":"df-positive-formula — 对真理谓词为正的公式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-positive-formula","aliases":["91-df-positive-formula"],"display":"df-positive-formula — 对真理谓词为正的公式","depends_on":["[[91-df-language-with-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-positive-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-positive-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-positive-formula — 对真理谓词为正的公式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 的基本联结词为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\land,\\lor\">\\(\\neg,\\land,\\lor\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to,\\leftrightarrow\">\\(\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\)</span> 先按定义展开。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\">\\(o\\)</span> 遍历公式解析树中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的出现；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_\\neg(o,\\varphi)\">\\(n_\\neg(o,\\varphi)\\)</span> 是从根到该出现经过的否定节点数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_T}:\\forall o\\in\\operatorname{Occ}_T(\\varphi)\\ [n_\\neg(o,\\varphi)\\equiv0\\pmod2]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_T}:\\forall o\\in\\operatorname{Occ}_T(\\varphi)\\ [n_\\neg(o,\\varphi)\\equiv0\\pmod2]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>没有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的公式自动为正。蕴涵前件翻转极性是定义展开的结果。\n原书 Lemma 15.4 实际证明 KF 中所有 T 正公式的统一去引号双条件；旧版否认 KF 对全部正公式恢复该模式是不正确的。\n正性并不保证标准部分模型中二值确定：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(t)\">\\(T(t)\\)</span> 可取间隙，故不能推出固定点选择无关。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 15.3、Lemma 15.4，印刷页 187–188，PDF 页 198–199。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-language-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-language-with-truth]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg,\\land,\\lor","display":false},{"tex":"\\to,\\leftrightarrow","display":false},{"tex":"o","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"n_\\neg(o,\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_T}:\\forall o\\in\\operatorname{Occ}_T(\\varphi)\\ [n_\\neg(o,\\varphi)\\equiv0\\pmod2]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T(t)","display":false}],"bytes":1267,"backlinks":[{"id":"b04a030dde171267","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"938378420d182ce3","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bd7b31bc9c6fc9f2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 